skinparam style strictuml

/'The GameManager creates the unique instance of Friend.
It launches a while loop for the 3 games.
At each iteration, it instantiates a new Game object (the current game), a new Opponent and a new GameBoard.
At the end of a Game object, if the player has won, the GameManager allows them to add a card to their deck before launching the next Game.'/

class main{
    + {static} main( args:String[*] )

